<title>BELGIUM: Belgian liquidity stable at money tender.</title>
<headline>Belgian liquidity stable at money tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank left</p>
<p>money market liquidity virtualy unchanged at its fixed-rate</p>
<p>tender for seven-day advances. Details -</p>
<p>    Value date Feb 26	 expiry on March 5  NBVA</p>
<p>    Amount allotted	    6.950 bln bfr    (6.975 bln *)</p>
<p>    Interest rate	     3.00 pct	    (3.00 pct **)</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids    111.725 bln bfr</p>
<p>Percentage of bids accepted  6.09 pct</p>
<p>* amount draining from the money market on Feb 26</p>
<p>** interest rate at previous tender on Feb 17</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
